---
description: Maintain the Agent Office changelog for user-visible changes
alwaysApply: true
---

- Update `CHANGELOG.md` in the same change as a user-visible feature, fix, or breaking change.
- Use concise entries under `Unreleased`, grouped as Added, Changed, Fixed, or Removed when appropriate.
- Preserve released history and do not invent release dates or successful validation.
- Move entries into a numbered release only when preparing a user-requested release.
